      "slug": "tooth-regrowth-usag1",
      "headline": "Antibody against USAG-1 regrows teeth in mice",
      "summary": "Researchers at Kyoto University and the University of Fukui reported that one dose of an antibody blocking the protein USAG-1 grew a whole new tooth in mice with congenital tooth agenesis, with similar results in ferrets. The paper appeared in Science Advances in February 2021.",
      "vertical": "mouth-and-teeth",
      "approach": "drug",
      "intervention": {
        "name": "Anti-USAG-1 antibody",
